--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
Lazy-wave power cable with a clamped hang-off on a vessel in prescribed 6-DOF motion
-- Geometry and properties match lozon_gomex80_power_cable.dat. The vessel record gives the
-- reference-point position, Euler angles and their exact rates for a 12 s surge, heave and pitch
-- motion with a C2 quintic ramp over the first 12 s; the hang-off point moves rigidly with it.
-- The hang-off is clamped (Rigid) along the static fairlead tangent, so the clamp turns with the
-- vessel pitch and BendMom1N1 reports the connection moment at End A.
