--------------------- OPTIONS -----------------------------------------------
9.80665  g                 - Gravitational acceleration (m/s^2) [default: 9.80665]
1025.0   rhoW              - Water density (kg/m^3) [default: 1025]
80.0     WtrDpth           - Water depth for the flat seabed (m) [default: absent standalone; host-owned OpenFAST]
1.0e5    kBot              - Seabed penalty stiffness base (Pa/m) [default: 1.0e5]
1.0e4    cBot              - Seabed normal damping base (Pa-s/m) [default: 1.0e4]
0.4      rhoInf            - Generalised-alpha spectral radius {0<=rhoInf<=1} [default: 0.4]
False    modified_newton   - Tangent-reuse mode {False=full Newton; True=guarded reuse} [default: False]
0.05     dtM               - CableDyn internal time step (s) [default: omitted standalone; 0.1 s target OpenFAST]
36.0     TMax              - Standalone simulation duration (s), including the 12 s smooth start
data/vessel/vessel_surge_heave_pitch_12s_dt005.txt vesselMotion - 6-DOF vessel record moving every Coupled point rigidly
0.0|0.0|0.0 vesselRef - Vessel reference point, rotation centre and RAO origin (m) [default: 0|0|0]
12.0     RangeStart        - First output time in the range graphs (s) [default: 0]
False    adaptive_mesh     - Automatic finite-EI refinement {False; True} [default: False]
True     tensile_safety    - Refine and reject local axial compression in this tensile cable
dynamic_solver 1.0e-4 1.0e-14 100 12 - Relative tolerance, absolute tolerance, max iterations, backtracks
none     frictionMu        - Seabed friction coefficient {none; value>=0} [default: none]
none     current           - Current model and velocity (m/s) {none; uniform; profile} [default: none]
none     waves             - Wave model and parameters (m, s, deg) {none; airy; jonswap} [default: none]
0        WaterKin          - Water-kinematics source {0/none; file; SEASTATE coupled only} [default: no policy]
-- Complete option/default reference: cabledyn_options_reference.dat and doc/options.rst.
